    "title": "Auburn conquers Alabama to earn first men's wheelchair basketball national title - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Pat Byington ,\n1 days ago The Auburn Tigers men’s wheelchair basketball team defeated the Alabama Crimson Tide this past weekend 70-59 to win its first national championship. Played in Tucson, Arizona, this year’s Men’s National Intercollegiate Wheelchair Basketball Tournament Final was the wheelchair basketball version of the Iron Bowl, pitting the No. 1 ranked Tide against a No. 2 Auburn squad. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
